### Send Expo Push Notification
# Replace the token with a real Expo push token for testing
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notifications/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "ExponentPushToken[xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx]",
  "title": "Test Notification",
  "body": "This is a test push notification sent from the API.",
  "data": {
    "type": "test",
    "screen": "home"
  },
  "priority": "high",
  "badge": 1,
  "sound": "default"
}

### Minimal request (required fields only)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notifications/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "ExponentPushToken[xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx]",
  "title": "Hello",
  "body": "World"
}

### Invalid token (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notifications/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "invalid-token",
  "title": "Hello",
  "body": "World"
}

### Missing required fields (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notifications/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "ExponentPushToken[xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx]",
  "title": "Hello"
}
